38276>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent Zoom from a Zoom.
38276>>>                Case Break
38277>>>
38277>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38277>>>
38277>>>        Case End
38277>>>
38277>>>        Send SetActionButtons
